              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"hero-interior\"><div class=\"hero-interior__inner\"><div class=\"hero-interior__eyebrow\">The Next Season</div><h1 class=\"hero-interior__headline\">The Next Season.</h1><p class=\"hero-interior__subheadline\">One newsletter. From the two of us. About the life after the practice.</p><div class=\"hero-interior__body\"><p>No fluff. No \"5 tips for a better work-life balance.\" Real stories from people who've made the transition. Honest talk about what it takes to leave. And early access to events, conversations, and the Exit to Client model.</p></div><form class=\"newsletter-form\"><input type=\"email\" placeholder=\"Enter your email\" required><button type=\"submit\" class=\"btn btn--white\">Join The Next Season →</button></form></div></div>"
              },
