              "settings": {
                "html": "<div class=\"section section--warm\"><div class=\"section__inner--narrow\"><h2 class=\"section__headline section__headline--center\">What you'll get</h2><div class=\"features\"><div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"feature__icon\">📖</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Real Transition Stories</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Advisors who've made the leap. What they did, what they learned, what they wish they'd known sooner.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"feature__icon\">🔑</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Early Access</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Be the first to hear about Exit to Client developments, events, and conversations with people who've been where you are.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal\"><div class=\"feature__icon\">💬</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">Honest Talk</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>The stuff nobody says at industry conferences. What it actually feels like to leave, what you'll miss, and what you won't.</p></div></div><div class=\"feature reveal reveal-d1\"><div class=\"feature__icon\">🌍</div><h3 class=\"feature__title\">From the Road</h3><div class=\"feature__body\"><p>Jason and Tyler's full-time traveler life — and the perspective it gives on what matters after the practice.</p></div></div></div></div></div>"
